WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
The car meets air as it travels forward.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Doubling speed makes modeled drag four times larger.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Power to overcome drag rises with speed cubed.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The simplified model holds density, area and coefficient steady. Source: NASA Glenn.
